Proposed edit to https://gitlab.com/sosy-lab/sv-comp/bench-defs
File: benchmark-defs/category-structure.yml  (base: main @ 22caeaa, fetched 2026-10-09)

Adds 'saf' to the verifiers of the six C classes and the three Overall rankings,
so SAF runs every sub-category of those classes and receives class and Overall
scores (a tool outside every class has no class or Overall entry). Abstaining
(unknown) in a sub-category scores 0 and is never penalised. Supersedes the
opt_in-only draft of 2026-09-13; with class membership no opt_in entry is needed.

Apply with:  git apply submission/category-structure-classes.diff

